# Rancher's Plea (Q259): a level 15 character accepts at Edmond; Marius has no trade for fewer
# than ten giant spider skins; ten spiders give ten skins (a drop that cannot miss), which Marius
# trades for a healing potion, and his "more" link then says the player has too few; twenty-two
# more skins buy a second potion, the "more" link now offers the trades again, and ten skins buy
# fifty arrows; Edmond pays 25 for each of the two skins left, and the player quits; then
# relog. Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q259_ranchers_plea.golden
character Rancher 15
script quest.Q259_RanchersPlea
item 1495 1061 17
page default/30497.htm
page default/30405.htm
page script/quest/Q259_RanchersPlea/
npc edmond 30497 Folk 10 0 0
npc marius 30405 Folk 20 0 0
npc spider 20103 Monster 40 0 0

# Edmond: accept.
action edmond
action edmond
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=edmond item=0 page=default/30497.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass npc_{edmond}_Quest
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=edmond item=0 page=script/quest/Q259_RanchersPlea/30497-02.htm
